Use this section when setting up team-owned access, repositories and shared tooling:

- [Microsoft Entra ID](azuread.html): team access groups.
- [Github](github-repositories.html): team ownership and repository permissions.
- [Slack](slack.html): team contact and build notice channels.
- [Office 365](office365.html): team email groups.
- [Jenkins](jenkins.html): team metadata and build dashboard.
- [Jenkins setup](/cloud-native-platform/new-component/jenkins-repository.html): repository scanning, topics and deployment controls.

Use [Person](../person/) when adding people to an existing team.
